{"unit_id": "tag:01QJ:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是齐次（homogeneous）的，并且<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>中的仿射开集（affine open）。\n回顾，<MATH_0004>对应于<MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006>，见《构造》中的引理<REF_0001>。\n回顾，<MATH_0007>。\n由于<MATH_0008>带有一个丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf），它是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的，见第<REF_0002>节。\n由引理<REF_0003>可得一个典范同构（canonical isomorphism）\n<MATH_0009>。\n由于<MATH_0010>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，由此得到一个典范同构（canonical isomorphism）\n<MATH_0011>\n因为<MATH_0012>在<MATH_0013>上是丰沛（ample）的，所以我们知道<MATH_0014>有一族覆盖（covered）它的仿射开集（affine opens），其形式为<MATH_0015>。因此，只需证明所列映射（maps）能粘合（glue）于交叠处（overlaps）。这一点的证明从略。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "covered", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "overlaps", "target_term": "交叠处"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "指所选元素的齐次性。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指给定空间中为仿射的开集。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指对应的模。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "修饰此处所带的可逆层。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "指层的可逆性。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指此处所带的丰沛可逆层。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指由存在丰沛可逆层所推出的拟紧性。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "指由存在丰沛可逆层所推出的拟分离性。"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "指由所引引理得到的同构。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "指用于得到下一同构的拟凝聚性。"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "指利用拟凝聚性从前一个同构得到的同构。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "指用于得到下文仿射开覆盖的丰沛性。"}, {"source_term": "covered", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指一族仿射开集对给定空间的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指所给形式的各个仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指前面列出且需要粘合的映射。"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "指在交叠处粘合所列映射。"}, {"source_term": "overlaps", "target_term": "交叠处", "context": "指覆盖中各开集的交叠部分。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01QK:statement", "translation": "在引理<REF_0001>的假设下，沿用其中的记号。\n将该引理中列出的映射（map）记为<MATH_0001>。\n注意，同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0002>（引理<REF_0002>）恰为<MATH_0003>。\n考虑乘法（multiplication）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0004>\n见《构造》中的等式（<REF_0003>）。\n将其拉回（Pull this back）到<MATH_0005>，并考虑\n<MATH_0006>\n这里用到了显然的等同（identification）\n<MATH_0007>。\n此图表（diagram）交换（commutes）。证明从略。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Pull this back", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指为所引引理中列出的映射指定记号。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指所引引理中的同构。"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法", "context": "指给出所列映射的乘法运算。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指由乘法给出的映射。"}, {"source_term": "Pull this back", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "指将前述乘法映射拉回到给定对象。"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同", "context": "指写出此图时所用的等同。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指所列对象与映射组成的图表。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "断言所列图表交换。"}], "notes": []}
